              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the human race had spread all over the world, and daughters were being born, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "some of the heavenly beings",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.2; 6.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "heavenly beings",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sons of the gods",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sons of God.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " saw that these young women were beautiful, so they took the ones they liked. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “I will not allow people to live for ever; they are mortal. From now on they will live no longer than 120 years.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 13.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days, and even later, there were giants on the earth who were descendants of human women and the heavenly beings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.4; 6.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "heavenly beings",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sons of the gods",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sons of God.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " They were the great heroes and famous men of long ago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
