        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 24.37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 17.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " saw how wicked everyone on earth was and how evil their thoughts were all the time, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he was sorry that he had ever made them and put them on the earth. He was so filled with regret ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that he said, “I will wipe out these people I have created, and also the animals and the birds, because I am sorry that I made any of them.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was pleased with Noah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.9+GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9",
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 2.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the story of Noah. He had three sons, Shem, Ham, and Japheth. Noah had no faults and was the only good man of his time. He lived in fellowship with God, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.9+GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9",
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but everyone else was evil in God's sight, and violence had spread everywhere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God looked at the world and saw that it was evil, for the people were all living evil lives.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God said to Noah, “I have decided to put an end to the whole human race. I will destroy them completely, because the world is full of their violent deeds. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Build a boat for yourself out of good timber; make rooms in it and cover it with tar inside and out. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make it 133 metres long, 22 metres wide, and thirteen metres high. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make a roof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "roof",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "window.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for the boat and leave a space of 44 centimetres between the roof and the sides. Build it with three decks and put a door in the side. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am going to send a flood on the earth to destroy every living being. Everything on the earth will die, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but I will make a covenant with you. Go into the boat with your wife, your sons, and their wives. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take into the boat with you a male and a female of every kind of animal and of every kind of bird, in order to keep them alive. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.19+GEN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.19",
              "GEN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take along all kinds of food for you and for them.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 11.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noah did everything that God commanded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
